# XALT Correctness Checks
- Whenever the assistant deals with `XALT` (setup, configuration, environment variables, linker wrapping, tracking behavior, CLI/config keys, or troubleshooting), verify correctness against:
  - https://github.com/xalt/
  - https://xalt.readthedocs.org/
- If the upstream sources conflict with existing local assumptions, defer to the upstream sources and call out the discrepancy.
